      "sha": "f71c634aacae7b43af5946665a3837d6db1d1d84",
      "message": "feat: add lint for multiple sequential reads of the same storage key\n\nAdds the soroban_redundant_storage_read lint that detects redundant\nget/has calls on the same Soroban storage key (Instance, Persistent,\nTemporary) without an intervening write. Uses check_block with per-block\nstate tracking for reliable sequential statement analysis.\n\n- New lint: SOROBAN_REDUNDANT_STORAGE_READ (warn)\n- Detects get->get, has->get, has->has of the same key\n- Write (set) resets tracking\n- Full UI test fixtures and real_sdk integration tests\n- Updated docs with scope/limitations documented\n\nCloses #48",
      "isVerified": false,
      "authoredAt": "2026-07-25T12:04:43Z"
    },
